            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Biblical Times</strong><br>\nThe history of the region that today comprises Israel and Palestine dates far back to biblical times. Various peoples, including the Hebrews, the Philistines, and others, settled in this region. Historical and archaeological evidence shows the complex past of this area and the diverse cultural and religious influences that intersected here.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Ottoman Empire</strong><br>\nUntil the end of World War I, the territory of modern-day Israel and Palestine was part of the Ottoman Empire. With the empire's defeat in 1918 and the disintegration of the Ottoman Empire, borders in the Middle East were redrawn. European powers, particularly Great Britain and France, played a crucial role in determining these new boundaries.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The British Mandate</strong><br>\nAfter World War I, the area came under British control and became known as the \"British Mandate for Palestine.\" During this time, there was increased Jewish immigration to the region, driven by the Zionist dream of establishing a Jewish state. But the Arab-Palestinian population also aspired to self-determination and independence.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
